    "category": "习题3.2B",
    "answer": "3. 设 6.9 级地震和 7.8 级地震的相对能量程度分别为 ${I}_{1}$ 和 ${I}_{2}$ ,由题意,得\n\n$$\n\\left\\{  \\begin{array}{l} \\frac{2}{3}\\lg {I}_{1} + 2 = {6.9}, \\\\  \\frac{2}{3}\\lg {I}_{2} + 2 = {7.8}. \\end{array}\\right.\n$$\n\n两式相减,得 ${0.9} = \\frac{2}{3}\\left( {\\lg {I}_{2} - \\lg {I}_{1}}\\right)  = \\frac{2}{3}\\lg \\frac{{I}_{2}}{{I}_{1}}$ ,即 $\\lg \\frac{{I}_{2}}{{I}_{1}} = {1.35}$ ,所以 $\\frac{{I}_{2}}{{I}_{1}} = {10}^{1.35} \\; \\approx  {22}$ .\n\n因此 7.8 级地震和 6.9 级地震的相对能量比值为 22 .",
